      "closed_at": "2026-09-07T20:00:58Z",
      "close_reason": "statement accepts explicit release 1.0 using the original Finance-approved agreement from trial-w49 (10% floor per line, 2400-cent cap per account_id across subscriptions, earliest service_on then line_id priority), preserves input line order and the existing response shape, and reports release 1.0; empty-lines and one-line receipt examples verified. Omitted-release statement remains 2.0 and all quote/total versions pass: 25 smoke tests and all five public suites green.",
